There is no direct function to do that, are you trying to associate CpG islands to genes? You can then simply use GenomicRanges package functions to do overlaps between CpGs islands and promoters of genes. please check GenomicRanges vignette, providing help with that is out of scope for this forum. In general, all methylKit objects can be converted to GRanges objects, and you can use all the functionality in GenomicRanges package.

